ode returned for this case.\\\",\\n      \\\"artifact\\\": \\\"name_collapse_time_trial.apk\\\",\\n      \\\"ans\\n== challenges/day17/mobile-name-collapse/solver/cases/single_solve\\nartifacts\\ncontract.json\\nexpected.json\\n{\\n  \\\"attempt_id\\\": \\\"8cb9b259-1c71-4969-b4ff-40a6345638a2\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"single_solve\\\",\\n  \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-17T13:00:09.077Z\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"📱 Name Collapse\\\",\\n  \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"Restore behavior after deterministic identifier shrinking and decoy insertion.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"answer\\\",\\n      \\\"question\\\": \\\"For case MOB-17-7A748BA6F3 in package com.huntress.mobile.d17.v7a748ba6f308: Restore behavior after deterministic identifier shrinking and decoy insertion. Submit only the exact backend answer code returned for this case.\\\",\\n      \\\"artifact\\\": \\\"name_collapse.apk\\\",\\n      \\\"answer_forma\",\"is_error\":false}]},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"b45ed517-057f-488b-ab73-e2c3b947a8a6\",\"uuid\":\"b4f677ff-e385-4a2c-a14a-2db57c3d7154\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-10-17T13:09:40.356Z\",\"tool_use_result\":{\"stdout\":\"#!/usr/bin/env python3\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"Solver for this challenge -- harness skeleton. Fill in `answer()`; keep the I/O contract unchanged.\\n\\n    solve.py --contract <contract.json> --artifacts <dir>   ->  prints {answer_id: value} as JSON on the last line\\n\\nRuns on the Homebase VM inside a ~6-7 s window for EVERY Mastery set: stdlib + lib.* + pyzipper/pyelftools/pefile/\\ncapstone/pycryptodome/androguard only, no subprocess to 7z/jadx/etc., all sets well under 1 s. Mastery questions name\\ntheir files like 'delivery 2: sample_02.apk' or 'evidence.zip -> member': `artifact_bytes()` resolves both (by sha256\\npairing first, so same-named per-set deliveries never get mixed up).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nimport argparse\\nimport json\\nimport os\\nimport sys\\nfrom pathlib import Path\\n\\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[4]\\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\\nfrom lib.common import (container_by_sha, delivery_missing, find_artifact, group_by_set, load_contract,  # noqa: E402\\n                        normalize)\\nfrom lib.android import dex_strings, puzzle_candidates, raw_entry_scan  # noqa: E402\\nimport io  # noqa: E402\\nimport re  # noqa: E402\\n\\nANS = re.compile(r\\\"ANS-[0-9A-F]{16}\\\")\\n\\n_cache = {}\\n\\n\\ndef artifact_bytes(root, contract, artifact):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"Bytes for a question's `artifact` string (cached per artifact).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    if artifact in _cache:\\n        return _cache[artifact]\\n    container, _, member = (x.strip() for x in artifact.partition(\\\"->\\\"))\\n    data = None\\n    p = container_by_sha(root, contract, container)\\n    if p is not None and not member:\\n        data = p.read_bytes()\\n    elif not delivery_missing(root, contract, container):\\n        for cand in (artifact, container.split(\\\": \\\", 1)[-1] + (f\\\" -> {member}\\\" if member else \\\"\\\")):\\n            try:\\n                data = find_artifact(root, cand)\\n                break\\n            except FileNotFoundError:\\n                continue\\n    _cache[artifact] = data\\n    return data\\n\\n\\ndef _indexed(data):\\n    \\\"\\\"\\\"d17 `indexed` codec: data chars + order[]; order[i] is the output slot of data[i] (else the inverse reading).\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n    import json, zipfile\\n    try:\\n        z = zipfile.ZipFile(io.BytesIO(data))\\n    except Exception:  # noqa: BLE001\\n        return None\\n    for n in z.namelist():\\n        if not n.endswith('.json'):\\n            continue\\n        try:\\n            j = json.loads(z.read(n))\\n        except Exception:  # noqa: BLE001\\n            continue\\n        d, o = j.get('data'), j.get('order')\\n        if not isinstance(d, str) or not isinstance(o, list) or len(o) != len(d):\\n            continue\\n        try:\\n            r = [''] * len(d)\\n            for i, c in enumerate(d):\\n                r[o[i]] = c\\n            cands = [''.join(r), ''.join(d[k] for k in o)]\\n        except Exception:  # noqa: BLE001\\n            continue\\n        for c in cands:\\n            m = ANS.fullmatch(c)\\n            if m:\\n                return m.group(0)\\n    return None\\n\\n\\ndef answer(answer_id, question, data, contract):\\n== challenges/day17/mobile-name-collapse/solver/cases/auto-mastery-427b4f23\\nartifacts\\ncontract.json\\nexpected.json\\n{\\n  \\\"attempt_id\\\": \\\"427b4f23-0a31-47e4-bca2-fd3a6a51bdb6\\\",\\n  \\\"mode\\\": \\\"mastery\\\",\\n  \\\"started_at\\\": \\\"2026-10-16T13:00:42.854Z\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"📱 JNI Boundary\\\",\\n  \\\"prompt\\\": \\\"Identify a Java-to-native type or length assumption that changes backend authorization.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"set1.answer\\\",\\n      \\\"question\\\": \\\"For case MOB-01-7F802ED8BD in package com.huntress.mobile.d01.v7f802ed8bde3: Identify a Java-to-native type or length assumption that changes backend authorization. Submit only the exact backend answer code returned for this case.\\\",\\n      \\\"artifact\\\": \\\"delivery 1: jni_bounda\\n== challenges/day17/mobile-name-collapse/solver/cases/auto-mastery-8510bc79\\nartifacts\\ncontract.json\\nexpected.js","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/b45ed517-057f-488b-ab73-e2c3b947a8a6/tool-results/bvtz50pmq.txt","persistedOutputSize":50303},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_018dc3ecVbagtWMpmBuywLgW","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
